<title>JAPAN: Moody's assigns Aaa to Aquarius Asset bonds.</title>
<headline>Moody's assigns Aaa to Aquarius Asset bonds.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moody's Investors Service said on Wednesday that it had assigned an Aaa rating to 10 billion yen worth of Aquarius Asset Funding Corp's lease-backed bonds.</p>
<p>Moody's said that the bonds, comprising 20 tranches, were publicly sold in Japan.</p>
<p>The bonds are backed by lease receivables originated by Japan Leasing Corp, Moody's said.</p>
</text>
